      <div class="cs2-eyebrow">Confidential lending technology case study</div>
      <h1>8 qualified meetings. 2 new customers. <span class="highlight">2 more opportunities advancing.</span></h1>
      <p class="cs2-lead">An income verification software provider needed credible conversations with credit unions—not a generic FinTech list. The 90 day campaign centered on lending workflows, human outreach, disciplined qualification, and a handoff the product team could use.</p>
      <div class="cs2-note"><i></i> Credit unions · Income verification software · Appointment setting</div>
    </div>

